cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use FloodLite in your research, please cite the manuscript (in submission) and the archived code release."
title: "FloodLite: A Multi-Platform Edge-Deployment Benchmark for Lightweight Flood Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code, pre-trained PyTorch checkpoints, ONNX FP32 / INT8 exports,
  and per-platform benchmarking harnesses for FloodLite -- a systematic
  edge-deployment benchmark for lightweight UNet flood segmentation on Apple
  M2 Pro CPU and browser WebAssembly, with an honest knowledge-distillation
  ablation and an architecture-dependent post-training-quantization stability
  characterisation.
